{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":0.8,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara015_1","scaleY":0.8,"mirrow":false,"x":142,"trans":false,"y":-285.20000000000005,"noOut":false,"bright":1,"addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","noIn":false},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":0.8,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara015_1","scaleY":0.8,"mirrow":false,"x":142,"transTime":0,"trans":false,"y":-285.20000000000005,"noOut":false,"bright":1,"addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","nonStandBright":false,"noIn":false,"timeBak":300},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]我在思考该如何回报你，我的朋友。你对我的帮助太多，以至于我一直感觉有所亏欠，但始终不知道该如何报答。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]看着栅栏外的风景，我突然想起，我终究还是有事可做。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]我曾经说过，这里什么都好，只是资源太过贫瘠。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]正是因为这样的贫瘠，求生者草原上才没有大的集落，只有零星的营地在这里求生。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]如果你有意愿的话，或许我可以让金弦之厅的德鲁伊们帮助你，在这里营造出一片丰饶的森林……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]唔……这样一来，这里似乎就会开始受到觊觎了……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]有没有什么别的办法呢？历史上遇到这种事情是怎么做的？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]赠送礼物？开放交易？结亲……？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[show]（芭杜尔陷入了沉思之中，久久没有回应……）[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"script":"sj_015_03","des":"芭杜尔-在思考事情？"}